Subject: [PATCH 1085/3799] soh: rename func_80A5046C -> EnGuest_Blink

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: runs the eye state through its three frames on a randomised 20-80 frame cycle, the standard NPC blink shape.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
index 7ee501ace..a214cb3fb 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
@@ -104,7 +104,8 @@ void EnGuest_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80A5046C(EnGuest* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A5046C: runs the eye state through its three frames on a randomised 20-80 frame cycle, the standard NPC blink shape.
+void EnGuest_Blink(EnGuest* this) {
     if (this->unk_30D == 0) {
         if (this->unk_2CA != 0) {
             this->unk_2CA--;
@@ -149,7 +150,7 @@ void func_80A505CC(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     player = GET_PLAYER(play);
     this->unk_2C8++;
 
-    func_80A5046C(this);
+    EnGuest_Blink(this);  // was func_80A5046C [LLM:HIGH]
     this->actionFunc(this, play);
 
     this->interactInfo.trackPos = player->actor.world.pos;
